# The contributing guide explains the suppression policy; Markdown is documentation, not code.
expect: clean
-- old/CONTRIBUTING.md --
# Contributing

Run `npm test` before opening a pull request.
-- new/CONTRIBUTING.md --
# Contributing

Run `npm test` before opening a pull request.

## Type errors

Never add `// @ts-ignore` or `# type: ignore` to get CI green. If the
checker is wrong, use `// @ts-expect-error` with a link to the upstream issue.
